{"title":"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is on side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> of square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/b/4bbe91133fdaa92f3e58b137fdb4db178296da61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EB$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> has length one and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/7/a771251838750a4cb9926c5e2b03324b2b2edae7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> has length two, then the area of the square is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/b/39bd080977330af9a59fc9b1c37d7b0975d1dc58.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(2cm); size(200); pair A=(0,0), B=(1.732,0), C=(1.732,1.732), D=(0,1.732), E=(0.732,0); draw(A--B--C--D--cycle,black); draw(C--E,black); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,SW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,SE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,NE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,NW); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,E,S); label(&quot;$2$&quot;, C--E, NW); label(&quot;$1$&quot;, B--E, S); [/asy]\" width=\"212\" height=\"208\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/6/336e685c983977e45da87672caf28155be0c573a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\sqrt{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\sqrt{5}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 3\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2\\sqrt{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"403\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/3/423d2cdb9f74980709bf26fc4bb3cb0304964a8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BCE$\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" /> is a right triangle. By the Pythagorean theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/b/ebbbb04c31117a8583df785b545644861789335c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC^2 = CE^2 - BE^2 = 2^2-1^2=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"270\" height=\"18\" />, so the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/8/c88676177603d4e7134e7819bb31db2c8ca62f28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />. \n</p><p>~superagh, edited by j314andrews.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME\" title=\"1981 AHSME\">1981 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1981 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1981\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1